>> f1 := Faayila haaraa: ['notafile'].
>> f2 := Faayila haaraa: ['/tmp/test.txt'].
(f2 jira) yoodhugaa: { f2 haqi.}.
Baʼii barreessi: f2 karaa.
f2 barreessi: ['Hello!'].
f2 dabaliboodatti: ['World!'].
Baʼii barreessi: f2 dubbisi.
(f2 jira) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['!']. }.
(f1 jira) yoodhugaa: { Baʼii barreessi: ['!']. }.
Baʼii barreessi: f2 guddina, barreessi: f1 guddina.
f2 haqi. Baʼii barreessi: f2 guddina.

